 "title": "NAFEMS LE1: elliptic membrane (3D thin plate)",
 "description": "NAFEMS benchmark LE1 (plane stress) modelled as a 3D plate, in mm. Quarter of an elliptic annular plate of total thickness 100 mm; only the half-thickness z in [0, 50] is modelled and z=0 is the plate's mid-plane of symmetry. Inner boundary (x/2000)^2 + (y/1000)^2 = 1, outer boundary (x/3250)^2 + (y/2750)^2 = 1. A uniform outward normal traction (tension) of 10 MPa acts on the outer elliptic face. Symmetry: ux=0 on x=0, uy=0 on y=0, uz=0 on z=0.",
